@startuml
title Payment transaction
actor Member
participant API
participant Domain
database Effects
Member -> API: pay(key, version)
API -> Domain: authenticate/authorize
Domain -> Effects: BEGIN; lock/version check
Domain -> Effects: calculate remaining from effects
alt valid unique payment
 Domain -> Effects: insert payment + settlement effect
 Domain -> Effects: COMMIT
else duplicate
 Domain --> API: original result
else conflict/overpayment
 Domain -> Effects: ROLLBACK
end
API --> Member: result
